<p>1) Nucleophilic reaction</p>

<p class="mt-align-center"><img alt="File:/C:\Users\Gantor\AppData\Local\Temp\msohtmlclip1\01\clip_image006.png" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/13417/3.jpg?revision=1" /></p>

<p>2) Carbonyl reforms with leaving group removal</p>

<p class="mt-align-center"><img alt="File:/C:\Users\Gantor\AppData\Local\Temp\msohtmlclip1\01\clip_image008.png" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/13418/4.jpg?revision=1" /></p>

<p>3) Nucleophilic reaction</p>

<p class="mt-align-center"><img alt="File:/C:\Users\Gantor\AppData\Local\Temp\msohtmlclip1\01\clip_image010.png" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/13419/5.jpg?revision=1" /></p>

<p>4) Protonation</p>

<p class="mt-align-center"><img alt="File:/C:\Users\Gantor\AppData\Local\Temp\msohtmlclip1\01\clip_image012.png" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/13420/6.jpg?revision=1" /></p>

